WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.091 --> 00:00:01.566
- Where's Brianne?

00:00:01.566 --> 00:00:02.940
- Right here, hi!

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.196
- [Kelly] What's up?

00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:05.789
Why did you request,

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:08.712
I mean that might be a top two favorite,

00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:11.022
like she's got so many hits, Reba.

00:00:11.022 --> 00:00:11.920
"Why Haven't I Heard From You"

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.534
is one of my favorite jams to sing.

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:14.367
Why'd you pick it though?

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:18.155
- I picked it because, my
mom is my best friend, Linda,

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:20.137
and she's completely selfless,

00:00:20.137 --> 00:00:23.646
she volunteers thousands
of hours in her community,

00:00:23.646 --> 00:00:27.108
and she was diagnosed with
terminal breast cancer

00:00:27.108 --> 00:00:28.265
and given two years,

00:00:28.265 --> 00:00:29.572
and that was four years ago,

00:00:29.572 --> 00:00:31.131
so she's still with us!

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.297
(audience claps)

00:00:32.297 --> 00:00:34.182
She's raised us kids and I promised her

00:00:34.182 --> 00:00:36.855
that when she beats it, we're
gonna take her to see Reba,

00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:38.458
and that is a goal of ours.

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.527
She's really sick, so having you sing it

00:00:40.527 --> 00:00:42.498
is the next best thing because
we absolutely love you--

00:00:42.498 --> 00:00:43.331
- [Kelly] Aww!

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:44.580
- and so thank you so much.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.519
- [Kelly] Did you say

00:00:45.519 --> 00:00:47.771
she was given two years
and it's been four?

00:00:47.771 --> 00:00:48.610
- [Brianne] Yes.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.838
- She's one hell of a fighter.

00:00:49.838 --> 00:00:51.427
- Yes, she absolutely is.

00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:52.519
- That's a beautiful thing,

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:55.331
four years and they gave
her two, she's got this.

00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:56.716
- We had a couple of close calls,

00:00:56.716 --> 00:00:58.056
but she's been good.

00:00:58.056 --> 00:01:01.227
- Come on up here, come on up here.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.529
(crowd cheers and claps)

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:05.915
- [Brianne] Thank you so much!

00:01:05.915 --> 00:01:07.218
I love it, thank you.

00:01:07.218 --> 00:01:10.750
- I was expecting like,
I don't know a fun thing,

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.770
and that's not a fun thing, I'm so sorry!

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:13.758
- She's fun, she's fun.

00:01:13.758 --> 00:01:17.248
- I know she's fun, but that's
just, that's a heavy thing.

00:01:17.248 --> 00:01:18.081
- Yeah.

00:01:18.081 --> 00:01:19.649
Well, tell me a little bit
more about your mom though,

00:01:19.649 --> 00:01:21.222
like why is she such a big Reba fan?

00:01:21.222 --> 00:01:23.583
- She's just always raised
us on country music,

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.498
and growing up...

00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:28.723
in the car, at home, she's
always played Reba for us.

00:01:28.723 --> 00:01:30.896
So we've just always
grown up with the music,

00:01:30.896 --> 00:01:34.693
and she's huge on country,
so I'm huge on country,

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:35.794
huge on Kelly!

00:01:35.794 --> 00:01:38.857
And so just you singing
it was so big for her.

00:01:38.857 --> 00:01:40.349
- Okay, well I love your mom.

00:01:40.349 --> 00:01:41.266
- She's awesome!

00:01:41.266 --> 00:01:43.428
- So, what's your mom
like, is she fun like you?

00:01:43.428 --> 00:01:44.382
- Oh, she's tons of fun.

00:01:44.382 --> 00:01:45.215
I can tell you stories,

00:01:45.215 --> 00:01:46.290
but they're probably not
appropriate for here.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.123
(laughing)

00:01:47.123 --> 00:01:48.580
But we've gone to Vegas--

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:49.885
- Oh my gosh, I love her.

00:01:49.885 --> 00:01:53.117
- For her 50th, and we have
get-togethers at the house

00:01:53.117 --> 00:01:54.824
and she hosts all the
holidays and all the parties.

00:01:54.824 --> 00:01:56.253
- [Kelly] Oh, she's a light!

00:01:56.253 --> 00:01:57.261
- She's so much fun.

00:01:57.261 --> 00:01:58.506
Even though she's sick,

00:01:58.506 --> 00:02:01.939
she makes sure that she's
the life of the party

00:02:01.939 --> 00:02:03.099
as best as she can be.

00:02:03.099 --> 00:02:05.782
And she still does everything
for everybody else,

00:02:05.782 --> 00:02:07.836
even though she's going through
what she's going through,

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.083
everybody else comes first.

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.141
(clapping)

00:02:10.141 --> 00:02:11.305
- That's a beautiful mom.

00:02:11.305 --> 00:02:12.226
- She's awesome.

00:02:12.226 --> 00:02:15.500
- Alright, I'm honored you
said I'm the next best thing,

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.284
you know, to Reba, but I think
your mom deserves the best

00:02:18.284 --> 00:02:21.514
so please welcome country
legend, Reba McEntire!

00:02:21.514 --> 00:02:23.780
(crowd cheers and claps)

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.961
- Shut up!

00:02:24.961 --> 00:02:26.165
Oh my god!

00:02:26.165 --> 00:02:28.312
(upbeat happy music)

00:02:28.312 --> 00:02:29.145
Oh my god!

00:02:29.145 --> 00:02:32.095
(upbeat happy music)

00:02:32.095 --> 00:02:33.947
I was not expecting that!

00:02:33.947 --> 00:02:37.395
Oh my gosh, hi it's so nice to meet you!

00:02:37.395 --> 00:02:40.675
Oh my gosh, you're amazing,
you're so beautiful!

00:02:40.675 --> 00:02:42.331
- Tell your mama hi for me, okay?

00:02:42.331 --> 00:02:46.604
- I will! You're so
beautiful, thank you so much.

00:02:46.604 --> 00:02:49.515
- Come on over here, and
you stand in the middle.

00:02:49.515 --> 00:02:51.431
Reba, you come on over here.

00:02:51.431 --> 00:02:52.551
Alright so--

00:02:52.551 --> 00:02:54.205
- [Brianne] You are so amazing, thank you.

00:02:54.205 --> 00:02:57.379
- Brianne, is there
anything you wanna tell her?

00:02:57.379 --> 00:02:59.776
- You are such an incredible motivation

00:02:59.776 --> 00:03:02.076
to me, my sisters, my brother, my mom.

00:03:02.076 --> 00:03:04.574
I mean, my mom listening to
your music uplifts her spirits.

00:03:04.574 --> 00:03:06.448
I mean, her license plate
even says "Survivor"

00:03:06.448 --> 00:03:07.281
after your song--

00:03:07.281 --> 00:03:08.198
- Great, great!

00:03:08.198 --> 00:03:10.031
- and we just, we love
you, so thank you so much

00:03:10.031 --> 00:03:11.665
for being that for her, for my family.

00:03:11.665 --> 00:03:13.587
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh, I've
never thought about that song,

00:03:13.587 --> 00:03:15.304
how perfect that song is.

00:03:15.304 --> 00:03:16.642
(crowd claps)

00:03:16.642 --> 00:03:18.872
All right, so since your
mom isn't well enough

00:03:18.872 --> 00:03:22.560
to join us today, we're
going to talk to her at home.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:25.295
Alright, so look in the
camera, and let's give,

00:03:25.295 --> 00:03:26.242
what's your mama's name again?

00:03:26.242 --> 00:03:27.075
- Linda.

00:03:27.075 --> 00:03:29.130
- Linda, we have somebody here

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.894
that might wanna say something to you.

00:03:30.894 --> 00:03:33.330
- Hey Linda, I'm Reba McEntire,
and I just wanna tell you

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.389
that my thoughts, my
prayers, go out to you,

00:03:36.389 --> 00:03:37.798
and hang in there girl!

00:03:37.798 --> 00:03:40.119
I know you're tough, you
can beat this sucker!

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.871
- [Kelly] Yeah, you've
already made it four years!

00:03:41.871 --> 00:03:42.704
(clapping)

00:03:42.704 --> 00:03:43.752
You've got this!

00:03:43.752 --> 00:03:45.825
Well thank you so much Brianne!

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.364
- [Brianne] Thank you so much!

00:03:47.364 --> 00:03:49.372
- [Kelly] Such a great
song, such a great pick!

00:03:49.372 --> 00:03:50.205
- Thank you so much!

00:03:50.205 --> 00:03:51.880
- [Reba] Tell your mom "hi".

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.676
- [Kelly] Alright let's take a seat ma'am!

00:03:53.676 --> 00:03:54.890
That was awesome!

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.410
Let's have a seat, okay.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.250
So, for this, this is so weird because,

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.798
you know when you're friends and family

00:04:00.798 --> 00:04:02.100
with someone and you
have them on your show

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.088
it's awkward! (laughs)

00:04:03.088 --> 00:04:05.050
I ended up marrying her oldest son and,

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.547
and you got stuck with me... more!

00:04:06.547 --> 00:04:07.380
- Thank goodness!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.584
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:08.584 --> 00:04:11.189
Thank goodness. And I'll
clap for that one too!

00:04:11.189 --> 00:04:12.433
(crowd claps)

00:04:12.433 --> 00:04:14.067
- [Kelly] I mean, out of
all of the fun we've had,

00:04:14.067 --> 00:04:16.915
I always have my little
moments with you because,

00:04:16.915 --> 00:04:18.267
I know we're friends and we're family,

00:04:18.267 --> 00:04:19.962
but you're always like that hero to me.

00:04:19.962 --> 00:04:20.795
- Aww!

00:04:20.795 --> 00:04:23.328
- [Kelly] Especially
musically, you're just a beast!

00:04:23.328 --> 00:04:25.639
Like a pioneer for women, it's insane!

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:26.505
(audience cheers)

00:04:26.505 --> 00:04:27.338
- Thank you.

00:04:27.338 --> 00:04:28.741
- And not just musically,

00:04:28.741 --> 00:04:30.781
like I think what's amazing
about your career is,

00:04:30.781 --> 00:04:32.521
you're a businesswoman, um,

00:04:32.521 --> 00:04:35.566
you've conquered Broadway,
you've conquered TV,

00:04:35.566 --> 00:04:38.080
you've conquered movies, animated films!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.540
I mean, you've done
everything you could possibly

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.530
want to do so my question is,

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.175
"What is the next mountain"?

00:04:44.175 --> 00:04:46.719
Because, you've done, you've already...

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.575
mastered everything! (laughs)

00:04:48.575 --> 00:04:50.091
- Well I haven't mastered
or conquered anything--

00:04:50.091 --> 00:04:51.129
- [Kelly] Yes you have!

00:04:51.129 --> 00:04:52.763
- I've just gotten to participate.

00:04:52.763 --> 00:04:55.121
People were nice enough
to let me be apart of,

00:04:55.121 --> 00:04:56.866
I'd tell you what I'd really love to do...

00:04:56.866 --> 00:04:57.699
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:04:57.699 --> 00:05:00.512
- I want to do an authentic Western movie.

00:05:00.512 --> 00:05:01.520
Or television show!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.353
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:05:02.353 --> 00:05:03.186
- A western.

00:05:03.186 --> 00:05:04.268
- People would love that!

00:05:04.268 --> 00:05:05.926
- [Reba] I love Westerns, love em!

00:05:05.926 --> 00:05:07.147
- Oh my god, there's so many avenues now!

00:05:07.147 --> 00:05:08.649
Netflix, Amazon, all the things!

00:05:08.649 --> 00:05:09.482
- [Reba] Everywhere!

00:05:09.482 --> 00:05:10.782
- We can make this happen!

00:05:10.782 --> 00:05:12.504
- Kelly Clarkson said so!

00:05:12.504 --> 00:05:13.337
Right there!

00:05:13.337 --> 00:05:14.516
(crowd claps)

00:05:14.516 --> 00:05:15.881
- [Kelly] Yes, and I think
people would love that!

00:05:15.881 --> 00:05:17.179
- I do too. I do too.

00:05:17.179 --> 00:05:19.028
- I would love, and this is only because

00:05:19.028 --> 00:05:20.862
when I first heard you,
it was a lot of like

00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:23.011
Oklahoma, kind of Texas
swing, kind of style?

00:05:23.011 --> 00:05:25.165
I would love an old school record!

00:05:25.165 --> 00:05:26.837
Like an old school country!

00:05:26.837 --> 00:05:28.383
I think that would be amazing!

00:05:28.383 --> 00:05:29.216
- Well thanks!

00:05:29.216 --> 00:05:31.018
- [Kelly] This is me asking as a fan!

00:05:31.018 --> 00:05:33.406
Because my thing is...

00:05:33.406 --> 00:05:35.513
That's the kind of country music

00:05:35.513 --> 00:05:36.968
that I feel like separates it

00:05:36.968 --> 00:05:38.175
from other genres and it doesn't

00:05:38.175 --> 00:05:39.838
blur the lines of pop or anything.

00:05:39.838 --> 00:05:42.440
It's like that authentic
just story-telling of,

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.482
"She Thinks His Name Was
John", or "And Still", or...

00:05:45.482 --> 00:05:47.951
just all those songs are so meaningful

00:05:47.951 --> 00:05:50.736
and have changed people's
lives, along with Brianne!

00:05:50.736 --> 00:05:52.219
Oh by the way, that's my middle name!

00:05:52.219 --> 00:05:53.308
I just remembered that!

00:05:53.308 --> 00:05:54.745
(audience laughs)

00:05:54.745 --> 00:05:56.351
My husband is making fun of me back there

00:05:56.351 --> 00:05:57.913
and you know it! (laughs)

00:05:57.913 --> 00:06:00.420
Well as promised, I found
some old photos of you.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.440
Are you ready to go through them?

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.273
- Oh boy!

00:06:02.273 --> 00:06:04.303
- [Kelly] I'm excited, alright!

00:06:04.303 --> 00:06:05.494
- Alright, let's see what you've got!

00:06:05.494 --> 00:06:07.364
- [Kelly] Here is the first one.

00:06:07.364 --> 00:06:08.904
Yes! (laughs)

00:06:08.904 --> 00:06:10.382
Oh my gosh, how old are you there?

00:06:10.382 --> 00:06:11.791
- [Reba] I think second grade.

00:06:11.791 --> 00:06:13.000
- Oh my god, you're adorable!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.702
Look at that, you had that
big old hair going even then!

00:06:15.702 --> 00:06:17.550
You were like "Y'all
aren't ready for my hair!"

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:18.666
(Reba laughs)

00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:20.083
Okay next... yes!

00:06:21.201 --> 00:06:24.744
I mean, it looks like you're about to fall

00:06:24.744 --> 00:06:26.445
with the horse but you're not.

00:06:26.445 --> 00:06:28.802
- [Reba] Okay two things
about, three things about that.

00:06:28.802 --> 00:06:30.456
I've got the reins in the wrong hand.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:31.416
(Kelly laughs)

00:06:31.416 --> 00:06:35.280
That is my brother,
Pake's, calf-roping horse.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.946
He wasn't working too good for Pake,

00:06:36.946 --> 00:06:39.114
so Pake said I could run barrels on him.

00:06:39.114 --> 00:06:41.203
And I am rocking the plaid pants.

00:06:41.203 --> 00:06:42.711
- Yes you are.

00:06:42.711 --> 00:06:43.807
Yes you are ma'am!

00:06:43.807 --> 00:06:46.849
Fashion icon before it really even hit.

00:06:46.849 --> 00:06:47.993
Okay next.

00:06:47.993 --> 00:06:52.051
- [Reba] Oh! That day Kelly
I won a car for six months.

00:06:52.051 --> 00:06:52.884
- [Kelly] What!

00:06:52.884 --> 00:06:55.819
- I won a Ford Torino car for six months.

00:06:55.819 --> 00:06:58.608
And all you had to do
was fill out your little

00:06:58.608 --> 00:07:00.669
questionnaire thing, and then...

00:07:00.669 --> 00:07:02.721
That is the Kiowa Cowboy

00:07:02.721 --> 00:07:04.422
high school band right there.

00:07:04.422 --> 00:07:05.255
- Oh my god.

00:07:05.255 --> 00:07:07.122
- Oh you see the guy on
the right, Roger Wills?

00:07:07.122 --> 00:07:10.198
He's the band leader for Alan Jackson.

00:07:10.198 --> 00:07:11.235
- [Kelly] Oh no way!

00:07:11.235 --> 00:07:13.480
- And then Susie is in the
middle, and Pake on the left.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.123
And Gary Reburn and Kelly Rein.

00:07:15.123 --> 00:07:18.107
- Your whole family
sings, that's what I find,

00:07:18.107 --> 00:07:20.149
I know that, and I know that
a lot of people do know that.

00:07:20.149 --> 00:07:24.342
But it's insane like I'm
talking everyone sings well!

00:07:24.342 --> 00:07:25.932
Like it's crazy!

00:07:25.932 --> 00:07:28.515
- Well daddy, somebody asked
daddy one time and said,

00:07:28.515 --> 00:07:30.187
"Clark, do you play?"

00:07:30.187 --> 00:07:32.407
And he said "I used to
play on the linoleum".

00:07:32.407 --> 00:07:34.545
(Kelly laughs)

00:07:34.545 --> 00:07:35.927
- I loved your dad!

00:07:35.927 --> 00:07:37.765
- He's a character, he loved you.

00:07:37.765 --> 00:07:41.006
- [Kelly] I love it, okay next!

00:07:41.006 --> 00:07:42.089
- Oh my gosh!

00:07:42.089 --> 00:07:43.167
- Oh that's Winona--

00:07:43.167 --> 00:07:44.479
- And Trisha!-- - Is that Trisha?

00:07:44.479 --> 00:07:45.489
- Yeah, Bruce Hinton--

00:07:45.489 --> 00:07:46.330
- Whoa!

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.349
- Oh my gosh look at Trisha she's so cute!

00:07:48.349 --> 00:07:50.266
- [Kelly] Look at your
hair, you are so cute!

00:07:50.266 --> 00:07:52.478
Look at all of, y'all are so cute!

00:07:52.478 --> 00:07:53.998
- [Reba] When was that?

00:07:53.998 --> 00:07:55.664
- [Kelly] I don't know!

00:07:55.664 --> 00:07:57.486
You all have, are those records?

00:07:57.486 --> 00:07:58.319
- Uh-huh!

00:07:58.319 --> 00:07:59.606
- Those are all of your records.

00:07:59.606 --> 00:08:01.662
Oh my god this is what I'm talking about!

00:08:01.662 --> 00:08:03.956
See, this is 90's country right here!

00:08:03.956 --> 00:08:06.465
All of these women representing right now,

00:08:06.465 --> 00:08:09.544
and they don't play women
now, hardly, on country.

00:08:09.544 --> 00:08:10.789
What's wrong with y'all?

00:08:10.789 --> 00:08:11.622
- [Reba] They're missing out.

00:08:11.622 --> 00:08:13.281
- I know! Next.

00:08:13.281 --> 00:08:14.989
Oh this is us!

00:08:14.989 --> 00:08:16.416
- [Reba] That was for the duets album.

00:08:16.416 --> 00:08:17.249
- [Kelly] It was!

00:08:17.249 --> 00:08:18.164
- [Reba] You came and sang with me.

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:19.617
- It was so magical, it's
so funny because remember

00:08:19.617 --> 00:08:21.576
we actually recorded a
different song first?

00:08:21.576 --> 00:08:22.409
- [Reba] Uh-huh!

00:08:22.409 --> 00:08:24.275
- And then we ended up doing Crossroads,

00:08:24.275 --> 00:08:26.069
and then we ended up
doing "Because of You"

00:08:26.069 --> 00:08:27.254
and it was such a magical moment.

00:08:27.254 --> 00:08:28.528
- [Reba] Kelly, we look so young.

00:08:28.528 --> 00:08:30.114
- I know. I still look
good, I don't know--

00:08:30.114 --> 00:08:30.947
- [Reba] Oh shut up!

00:08:30.947 --> 00:08:33.255
- what you're talking about! (laughs)

00:08:33.255 --> 00:08:34.685
Next, oh I was here!

00:08:34.685 --> 00:08:35.566
- [Reba] Oh yeah!

00:08:35.566 --> 00:08:36.611
- [Kelly] This is the Kennedy--

00:08:36.611 --> 00:08:37.761
- [Reba] The Kennedy Center Honors,

00:08:37.761 --> 00:08:39.445
thank you for coming and singing for me.

00:08:39.445 --> 00:08:40.769
- I will do anything for you ever!

00:08:40.769 --> 00:08:42.793
- Thank you, thank you very much.

00:08:42.793 --> 00:08:44.053
- This was really awesome.

00:08:44.053 --> 00:08:45.416
- It was a lot of fun.

00:08:45.416 --> 00:08:49.341
- I generally don't get nervous,
but I'll tell you what...

00:08:49.341 --> 00:08:51.219
I about peed my pants at that one.

00:08:51.219 --> 00:08:52.187
- You did great!

00:08:52.187 --> 00:08:53.170
- [Kelly] I was nervous!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.671
Okay next.

00:08:54.671 --> 00:08:57.504
(audience cheers)

00:08:59.725 --> 00:09:00.947
Okay ma'am!

00:09:00.947 --> 00:09:01.780
- [Reba] Well--

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:02.906
- Is this in Vegas?

00:09:02.906 --> 00:09:03.739
- Uh-huh.

00:09:03.739 --> 00:09:05.308
- That's in Vegas, oh my gosh.

00:09:05.308 --> 00:09:07.531
Next, okay I feel bad about myself.

00:09:07.531 --> 00:09:09.477
Oh this is awesome, what's this?

00:09:09.477 --> 00:09:13.179
- [Reba] Oh, that's when I
was, no my 40th anniversary

00:09:13.179 --> 00:09:15.034
of being in the Grand Ole Opry!

00:09:15.034 --> 00:09:18.047
There's Vince Gill, Dolly
Parton, Carrie Underwood.

00:09:18.047 --> 00:09:19.272
(crowd claps)

00:09:19.272 --> 00:09:20.774
Aw, that's so sweet!

00:09:20.774 --> 00:09:23.731
- And you're actually reuniting,
with Dolly and Carrie!

00:09:23.731 --> 00:09:25.771
- Yes, Dolly, Carrie, and I,

00:09:25.771 --> 00:09:29.875
we are going to be co-hosting
the CMA awards this year!

00:09:29.875 --> 00:09:30.708
- I love it!

00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:32.083
(audience claps and cheers)

00:09:32.083 --> 00:09:33.134
- [Reba] How about that!

00:09:33.134 --> 00:09:33.967
- [Kelly] I couldn't think
of three better women!

00:09:33.967 --> 00:09:34.800
- [Reba] Thank you!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.633
- To do that.

00:09:35.633 --> 00:09:38.170
- Thank you, I'm thrilled
to death that they asked me!

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:40.641
- Yes, I mean what, of
course they asked you!

00:09:40.641 --> 00:09:41.892
They were like "We need a legend"!

